{"author_association": "NONE", "body": "The hash is simply the SHA256 of the 1327-byte Cosmic Duality binary artifact reconstructed from Phase 3.\n\nIt is used as a canonical reproducibility anchor to ensure that independent reconstructions match the same underlying byte sequence.\n\nIf your reconstructed 1327-byte artifact differs, I\u2019m happy to compare SHA256 outputs to identify where our derivations diverge.\n\n> \u0449\u043e?\n> \n> \u0417\u0432\u0456\u0434\u043a\u0438 \u0446\u0435 `4f7a1e4efe4bf6c5581e32505c019657cb7b030e90232d33f011aca6a5e9c081`\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f? \u0417\u0434\u0430\u0454\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f, \u0446\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0439\u0448\u043e\u0432 \u044f\u043a\u0438\u0439\u0441\u044c \u043c\u0430\u0433\u0456\u0441\u0442\u0440 \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0430.\n\n", "created_at": "2026-02-24T22:37:39Z", "html_url": "https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81#issuecomment-3955129364", "id": 3955129364, "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81", "minimized": null, "node_id": "IC_kwDOD23F087rvnwU", "performed_via_github_app": null, "pin": null, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3955129364/reactions"}, "updated_at": "2026-02-24T22:37:39Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3955129364", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263768898?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/vad