{"author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "body": "I think your initial assumptions are invalid. We don't know \"derived half/better_half addresses\" it's not confirmed what they are.\n\nCosmic Duality is AES encrypted, you'd know the key to be able to decrypt it.", "created_at": "2026-02-25T01:31:54Z", "html_url": "https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81#issuecomment-3956005101", "id": 3956005101, "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81", "minimized": null, "node_id": "IC_kwDOD23F087ry9jt", "performed_via_github_app": null, "pin": null, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3956005101/reactions"}, "updated_at": "2026-02-25T01:31:54Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3956005101", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115951?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/Naddiseo", "id": 115951, "login": "Naddiseo", "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExNTk1MQ==", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Naddiseo", "user_view_type": "public"}}
{"author_association": "NONE", "body": "Thanks for the comment.\n\nTo clarify \u2014 I\u2019m not asserting that any addresses are \u201cconfirmed by authority\u201d.\nMy point is strictly about reproducibility.\n\nFollowing the publicly documented Phase-1 \u2192 Phase-3 pipeline yields a 1327-byte artifact.\nIts SHA256 is:\n\n4f7a1e4efe4bf6c5581e32505c019657cb7b030e90232d33f011aca6a5e9c081\n\nThis hash is used purely as a reproducibility anchor \u2014 not as a secret.\n\nIf your reconstruction of the 1327-byte artifact differs, I\u2019m happy to compare SHA256 outputs to identify where our derivations diverge.\n\nNo private keys or sensitive material are being disclosed.", "created_at": "2026-02-25T05:58:13Z", "html_url": "https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81#issuecomment-3957032151", "id": 3957032151, "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81", "minimized": null, "node_id": "IC_kwDOD23F087r24TX", "performed_via_github_app": null, "pin": null, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3957032151/reactions"}, "updated_at": "2026-02-25T05:58:13Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3957032151", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263768898?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/vadiksh85-pixel", "id": 263768898, "login": "vadiksh85-pixel", "node_id": "U_kgDOD7jLQg", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel", "user_view_type": "public"}}
{"author_association": "NONE", "body": "> what?\n> \n> where does `4f7a1e4efe4bf6c5581e32505c019657cb7b030e90232d33f011aca6a5e9c081` come from? That seems invented by an llm\n\n\n\n> I think your initial assumptions are invalid. We don't know \"derived half/better_half addresses\" it's not confirmed what they are.\n> \n> Cosmic Duality is AES encrypted, you'd know the key to be able to decrypt it.\n\nTo avoid ambiguity, let\u2019s reduce this to a single technical point.\n\nDoes your reconstruction of the 1327-byte Cosmic Duality artifact produce a SHA256 different from:\n\n4f7a1e4efe4bf6c5581e32505c019657cb7b030e90232d33f011aca6a5e9c081 ?\n\nIf yes, please share the SHA256 of your 1327-byte output so we can identify where the derivations diverge.\n\nIf not, then independent implementations converge to the same artifact.\n\nThat is the only technical claim being made.", "created_at": "2026-02-25T10:25:54Z", "html_url": "https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81#issuecomment-3958266138", "id": 3958266138, "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/81", "minimized": null, "node_id": "IC_kwDOD23F087r7lka", "performed_via_github_app": null, "pin": null, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3958266138/reactions"}, "updated_at": "2026-02-25T10:25:54Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/3958266138", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263768898?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/vadiksh85-pixel", "id": 263768898, "login": "vadiksh85-pixel", "node_id": "U_kgDOD7jLQg", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/received_events", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/repos", "site_admin": false, "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel/subscriptions", "type": "User", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vadiksh85-pixel", "user_view_type": "public"}}
